    "description": "You lock onto the target designated by the <b>Target Acquisition</b> Talent. If the target leaves your line of sight, you automatically reacquire the <b>Target Lock</b> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> if the target comes back within your line of sight. You also gain a +5 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> skill when opposing the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks.",
